  <main id="main-content">
    <p>
      UX Day Graz 2027 brings together designers, developers, researchers and students
      who care about creating digital products that people enjoy using.
      This year's theme is <strong>"Human-centred design in the age of AI"</strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our speakers share practical experience from real projects: how to keep interfaces simple,
      how to make everyday design accessible and how to understand what users really need.
      We will also discuss what human designers can do that AI tools cannot.
    </p>

    <p>
      Attendance is free, but places are limited. Have a look at the program and register early
      to save your seat.
    </p>

